s/award_logo/1332/202102011411206820079.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Can Buy (4 out of 5)\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Can Buy or Not\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Can Buy (4 out of 5)</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Unlike competing products like the Razer Kishi V2 and the Backbone One, the Asus ROG Tessen stands out with its ability to fold such that its length is halved. In this folded state, it is possible to put it in a pocket, but only if you're wearing large cargo pant side pockets.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SINGAPORE</span> <span>07/26/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Tessen Mobile Controller Media review Award of Can Buy (4 out of 5)\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.canbuyornot.com/reviews/asus-rog-tessen-review-price/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202408301608395260839.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"PlayFront &quot;9&quot;\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Playfront\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>PlayFront &quot;9&quot;</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The workmanship is high quality and the design is well thought out. Anyone looking for a premium solution for gaming on their smartphone will find the perfect answer here.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>08/23/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Tessen Mobile Controller Media review Award of PlayFront &quot;9&quot;\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://playfront.de/hardware-test-asus-rog-tessen-so-muss-sich-mobile-gaming-2024-anfuehlen/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202406251512174250704.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"2024 Red Dot Product Design\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Red Dot\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>2024 Red Dot Product Design</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG Tessen Mobile Controller stands out for its compact dimensions and foldable design, making it particularly suitable for use on the go. It can be used with smartphones of any size. The extendable grips, reinforced by double aluminium bridges, ensure stability. Programmable rear paddles allow for the execution of complex commands while keeping the thumbs on the thumbsticks. The A, B, X, and Y buttons, as well as the D-pad, feature exclusive mechanical switches for exceptionally responsive \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>06/25/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Tessen Mobile Controller Media review Award of 2024 Red Dot Product Design\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.red-dot.org/project/rog-tessen-mobile-controller-70366\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202403071741436330804.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"iF Design Award 2024\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      iF Design Award 2024\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>iF Design Award 2024</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ROG Tessen Mobile Controller won the iF 2024 Design Award, one of the world's most prestigious design awards. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>03/07/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Tessen Mobile Controller Media review Award of iF Design Award 2024\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://ifdesign.com/en/winner-ranking/project/rog-tessen-mobile-controller/628816\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</